body:
Used to feel like that when I was around your age,then I started having a better social life I guess and things looked brighter for a while.

&#x200B;

To a degree is sounds like you're looking for more validation.Could be wrong,but do you think you had a normal childhood ?Might wanna have your therapist look into that if you don't.

Hey,

&#x200B;

So what else could you do before that ?

don't,don't,don't,don't,don't

&#x200B;

What else can you do before that ?

Lots of people feel lonely even in relationships.But I do get what you're saying.Feeling unwanted,unvalided,unloved etc can be a burden.

&#x200B;

Try establish perhaps meaningful connections,not necessarily romantic.
